The system made enqueue idempotent by adding a membership flag to prevent a second enqueue of an actor already on a hart's backlog. This prevents the tail of the list from pointing at itself, which would cause the selector to walk a cycle forever. A cycle guard in the walk now names the ring to detect and prevent this corruption.

