The system verifies compaction idempotency by ensuring that running `QL.compact` on an already compacted disk results in an identical state, specifically where the new head equals the previous head. It detects torn appends by setting the `mTorn` flag, forcing an update with `QL.ensure`, and then checking if the commit flag remains set to 1, indicating the system refused to finalize the incomplete operation.

