The DATA region enforces an append-only binding to ensure that existing records are never overwritten in place, preserving the immutable history of values. When a new record is appended beyond the current `dataEnd`, the system returns `Err` rather than modifying the existing data, which maintains the durability and traceability of the name-to-value history.
