    admit_oldest_backlog_actor();
} else {
    # Perform weighted reservoir sampling
    select_weighted_random_actor(acb->weight);
}
```

When no backlog actor has waited longer than `tau` admissions, the scheduler uses a default tier that performs a single-pass weighted reservoir selection over actors based on their `acb->weight`, driven by a per-hart LCG seeded from the hart ID. The default value for `FPR_TAU` is 64.

