```fpr
spawnUart me =
  a = spawn UartM.actor;
  r1 = uartCall me a UartM.UOpen;
  _ = receiveFrom me a r1; -- Verify open
  r2 = uartCall me a (UartM.UBuf 8192);
  _ = receiveFrom me a r2; -- Verify buffer
  r3 = uartCall me a UartM.UShare;
  _ = receiveFrom me a r3; -- Verify share
  a.
```

